.TH QUIPU-EXPLAIN 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-explain \- Trace a derived fact back to its premises
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu explain\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-depth\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubject\fR> <\fIpredicate\fR> <\fIobject\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Trace a derived fact back to its premises
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-depth\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Maximum explanation depth
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIsubject\fR>

.TP
<\fIpredicate\fR>

.TP
<\fIobject\fR>

